{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48831","headline":"奉使过石门瀑布 · 丘丹","name":"奉使过石门瀑布","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪上望悬泉，耿耿云中见。\n披榛上岩巘，绝壁正东面。\n千仞泻联珠，一潭喷飞霰。\n嵯灇满山响，坐觉炎氛变。\n照日类虹蜺，从风似绡练。\n灵奇既天造，惜处穷海甸。\n吾祖昔登临，谢公亦游衍。\n王程惧淹泊，下磴空延眷。\n千里雷尚闻，峦回树葱蒨。\n奔波恭贱役，探讨媿前彦。\n永欲洗尘缨，终当惬兹愿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘丹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}